# Implementation Plan - Full Application Redesign

Complete overhaul of the application design, moving away from the Apple-inspired aesthetic to a modern, vibrant blue/purple/green palette. This includes a new loading screen, a split-screen authentication layout, and a developer tips section.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This is a destructive update! I will be removing the existing Apple-inspired design and components (`AppleLogo`, [GlassCard](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/ui/GlassCard.tsx#12-29), `PremiumButton`, etc.) once the new design is integrated.
> The new design features a split-screen layout:
> - **Left Side**: Image or Developer Tips.
> - **Right Side**: Authentication Form (Login/Register) on a flip-card.
> - The positions swap when switching between Login and Register.

## Proposed Changes

### Global Styles

#### [MODIFY] [globals.css](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/globals.css)
- Replace Apple-specific variables and classes with a new color palette (Blues, Purples, Greens).
- Implement a global background consistent with the new theme.

### Components

#### [NEW] [AuthContainer.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthContainer.tsx)
- Orchestrates the split-screen layout.
- Manages the state for flipping and swapping sides.
- Handles the loading transition.

#### [NEW] [AuthCard.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthCard.tsx)
- The core flip-card component provided by the user (adapted to include API logic).

#### [NEW] [AuthCard.module.css](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthCard.module.css)
- The CSS provided by the user for the flip-card.

#### [NEW] [DevTips.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/DevTips.tsx)
- A component to display rotating developer tips or an image.

#### [DELETE] [AuthFlipCard.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthFlipCard.tsx) & [AuthFlipCard.css](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthFlipCard.css)
