## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Verify the initial loading screen appears on app load.
- Check the transition from loading to the auth screen.
- Test the flip-card animation and the side-swapping layout.
- Ensure the color palette matches the requested blues, purples, and greens.
- Verify that login and registration still work with the backend APIs.
